{"id":"652700","name":"枣糕","author":"森林小花熊_lZQJ","authorId":"10793829","desc":"","cover":"images/652700/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大枣","amount":"9个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"6个"},{"name":"低筋面粉","amount":"160g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄油","amount":"50克"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"2g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"4克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大枣先上锅中火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/652700/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去枣核。","img":"images/652700/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"枣切丁。","img":"images/652700/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"枣丁和150克牛奶小火炒成团，成枣泥。","img":"images/652700/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"六个鸡蛋黄加入枣泥。","img":"images/652700/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蛋清分离。","img":"images/652700/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把枣泥和蛋黄打发。","img":"images/652700/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蛋白和45克糖湿性打发和枣泥打发料混合，上下搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652700/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌好的样子。","img":"images/652700/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"低筋粉，小苏打，泡打粉混合。","img":"images/652700/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"黄油和糖。","img":"images/652700/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"黄油加热成液态。","img":"images/652700/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"粉类筛入搅拌好的枣泥糊里，上下翻的方法搅拌均匀后最后+黄油液上下搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652700/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入活模具，上下160℃，烤50分钟。","img":"images/652700/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"烤好脱模。","img":"images/652700/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/652700/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/652700/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}